// Title: NTFS Alternate Data Stream
// ID: 8c521530-5169-495d-a199-0a3a881ad24e
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Sami Ruohonen
// Date: 2018-07-24
// Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1564.004, attack.execution, attack.t1059.001
// Description: Detects writing data into NTFS alternate data streams from powershell. Needs Script Block Logging.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((where(ScriptBlockText ICONTAINS "set-content") OR where(ScriptBlockText ICONTAINS "add-content"))) AND (where(ScriptBlockText ICONTAINS "-stream")))
